Testing strategy

A two-tier approach:

- Fast unit tests (no running services): test_injection_unit.py (leetspeak/keylogger/reverse-shell regressions, imports the scanner directly) and
test_pii_unit.py (monkeypatches httpx to fake Presidio, verifiesginal text). These run on the host via requirements-dev.txt.
- Live integration tests (hit the running gateway over HTTP against real Ollama): test_auth.py (~6 cases), test_policy.py (~18 cases across 6 blocks — routing
tiers, all 5 policy rules, auth), test_inspection.py (~15 cases olds, output scanner, pipeline-field integrity), plustest_routing_multimodel.py (auto-mode two-hop) and the tests/attacks/ suite. A neat touch in conftest.py: tests fetch tokens from the /token endpoint rather
than copying the JWT secret. sentinel_test.rego unit-tests the packs/evaluation/run_comparison.py benchmarks against LLM Guard for a fair external comparison.

